:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CHGCMD/MODE'.Mode in which valid (MODE)
:P.The mode in which valid for this command.
:P.Up to 3 values can be given.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*SAME:EPK.
:PD.The value does not change.
:PT.:PK.*ALL:EPK.
:PD.All of them.
:PT.:PK.*SERVICE:EPK.
:PD.Service.
:EPARML.
:P.Also accepted&colon. *PROD, *DEBUG.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CHGCMD/ALLOW'.Where allowed to run (ALLOW)
:P.The where allowed to run for this command.
:P.Up to 9 values can be given.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*SAME:EPK.
:PD.The value does not change.
:PT.:PK.*ALL:EPK.
:PD.All of them.
:PT.:PK.*BATCH:EPK.
:PD.Batch jobs.
:PT.:PK.*INTERACT:EPK.
:PD.Interactive jobs.
:EPARML.
:P.Also accepted&colon. *BPGM, *IPGM, *BREXX, *IREXX, *EXEC, *BMOD,
*IMOD.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CHGCMD/ALWLMTUSR'.Allow limited users (ALWLMTUSR)
:P.The allow limited users for this command.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*SAME:EPK.
:PD.The value does not change.
:PT.:PK.*NO:EPK.
:PD.No.
:PT.:PK.*YES:EPK.
:PD.Yes.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CHGCMD/MAXPOS'.Max positional parameters (MAXPOS)
:P.The max positional parameters for this command.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*SAME:EPK.
:PD.The value does not change.
:PT.:PK.*NONE:EPK.
:PD.None.
:PT.:PV.number:EPV.
:PD.Type a whole number. The value must be from 0 to 99.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CHGCMD/PMTFILE'.Prompt file (PMTFILE)
