:HELP NAME='CHGCMD/CURLIB'.Current library (CURLIB)
:P.The current library of the job&colon. the library searched first by
name (after the system part of the library list) and where *CURLIB puts
new objects.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*SAME:EPK.
:PD.The value does not change.
:PT.:PK.*NOCHG:EPK.
:PD.Not changed.
:PT.:PV.name:EPV.
:PD.Type a name of up to 10 characters.
:EPARML.
:P.Also accepted&colon. *CRTDFT.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CHGCMD/PRDLIB'.Product library (PRDLIB)
:P.The product library of the command&colon. it is added to the library
list while the command runs.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*SAME:EPK.
:PD.The value does not change.
:PT.:PK.*NOCHG:EPK.
:PD.Not changed.
:PT.:PK.*NONE:EPK.
:PD.None.
:PT.:PV.name:EPV.
:PD.Type a name of up to 10 characters.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CHGCMD/PMTOVRPGM'.Prompt override program (PMTOVRPGM)
